# OpenSSH allowed-signers file for signed bankstatementparser.com releases.
#
# Release tags are signed with SSH keys (git's gpg.format=ssh), not OpenPGP,
# so this file is in OpenSSH allowed-signers format rather than an
# ASCII-armoured keyring. Verify a signed Git tag with Git 2.34 or later:
#
#   git -c gpg.ssh.allowedSignersFile=KEYS.asc tag -v v0.0.5
#
# Every key line is "principal keytype base64-key", with the key's
# fingerprint and host in the comment above it. KEYS.md lists the same
# fingerprints for out-of-band checks.
#
# Maintainer: Sebastien Rousseau
